abstract: "CrossTL translates GPU shaders and compute kernels between languages through CrossGL, a small intermediate language. Frontends import GLSL, HLSL, Metal, SPIR-V, CUDA, HIP, Slang and other sources into CrossGL, and code generators write CrossGL out as GLSL, HLSL, Metal, SPIR-V, WGSL and other targets."
